  "known_local_policies": [
    "Reverberations grants its original selected current minion a normal damage-dealt self-destruction trigger before ordinary current CopyMinion. Full-board failure still marks the original. Ordinary current-copy material carries that trigger to each successful copied delivery; no hidden random real/fragile split, no pair-global destruction. Grant-reaction transform windows remain local.",
    "Ice Block is a finite printed secret incoming-damage health rule. Existing numeric routing/modifiers, shield/immunity, health floors and durability replacement precede fatal checking. Positive actual health debit that would reach zero, without health-loss replacement, consumes the original opponent-turn secret and prevents the entire packet including armor absorption.",
    "Ordinary keyword grant expires_turn equals the actual current turn; immunity applies to later committed packets in the same simultaneous health batch. Original secret consumption and ability-grant event publication use the batch pending-event buffer; no reactions interleave inside the atomic batch. This exact predamage/reveal ordering is a local policy pending CN calibration.",
    "Direct health loss, health setting and health payment are not damage. Own-turn lethal damage does not consume the opponent-turn secret. Complete source lists remain closed until all dependencies are ready; version/hotfix and CN edge calibration are deferred."
  ],
